DEFINITIONS

"Software" means the Zorynex Provable AI source code, documentation, tools,
and associated files published at github.com/zorynex/provable-ai.

"Commercial Use" means any use of the Software in a product, service, or
workflow that is offered to third parties, generates revenue, or operates in
a production environment.

"Evaluation Use" means running the Software locally, reading the source code,
running tests, and assessing whether the Software meets your requirements, for
non-commercial purposes only.

"Zorynex" means the legal entity operating under the name Zorynex,
contactable at hanif@zorynex.co.

